OpenCreator Notifier
Third-party attribution and modification notice

OpenCreator Notifier is a notification plugin developed for
OpenCreator and Flashforge Creator 5.

Notification delivery is powered by Apprise.

Apprise:
  Project: Apprise
  Repository: https://github.com/caronc/apprise
  License: BSD 2-Clause License

Apprise is used to provide notification services through
supported messaging platforms: Discord, Email (SMTP), Google Chat, Gotify, Matrix, Mattermost, Microsoft Teams, ntfy, Pushover, Slack and Telegram.

OpenCreator Notifier includes:
  - Apprise integration
  - 11 integrated notification providers
  - Standalone web interface
  - English and Italian translations
  - Provider and notification management
  - Klipper macro monitoring
  - Moonraker integration
  - OpenCreator plugin lifecycle management

OpenCreator Notifier is an independent project.
It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Apprise maintainers.

Third-party licenses and notices are retained where required.

